{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-start-bedopen-basic03|T52", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You lie down on the sofa-bed. Its frame creaks.", "passage": "sleep-start-bedopen-basic03", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-hub|T58", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "The events of the day run through your head.", "passage": "sleep-hub", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-hub|T59", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "The streets… the passengers… their faces… their problems…", "passage": "sleep-hub", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-tired-mid01|T70", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Your brain is running at full speed… your body aches and you are in pain.", "passage": "sleep-tired-mid01", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-tired-mid01|T71", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You can tell you need to get more sleep…", "passage": "sleep-tired-mid01", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-tired-high01|T76", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You yawn. Tears form at the corners of your eyes.", "passage": "sleep-tired-high01", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-tired-high01|T77", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You don’t know how much longer your body will hold up if you keep going at this rate…", "passage": "sleep-tired-high01", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-tired-high01|T78", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "If your body…", "passage": "sleep-tired-high01", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-finance-danger01|T87", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Your thoughts keep going back to your money problems…", "passage": "sleep-finance-danger01", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-finance-danger01|T88", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "If you lose your job… who knows what Busset has in mind?", "passage": "sleep-finance-danger01", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-finance-danger01|T89", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You toss and turn in your bed for a few seconds…", "passage": "sleep-finance-danger01", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-finance-danger01|T90", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Tired…", "passage": "sleep-finance-danger01", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-finance-danger02|T95", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You toss and turn in your bed for a few minutes…", "passage": "sleep-finance-danger02", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-finance-danger02|T96", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Your thoughts turn to one thing: money.", "passage": "sleep-finance-danger02", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-finance-danger02|T97", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "With the intention of pushing these unpleasant thoughts out of your mind, you promise yourself you’re going to pour your energy into your passengers.", "passage": "sleep-finance-danger02", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-finance-danger02|T98", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "That way… you can avoid…", "passage": "sleep-finance-danger02", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-finance-danger02|T99", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "More hassle…", "passage": "sleep-finance-danger02", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-hub2|T104", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You glance at your investigation board…", "passage": "sleep-hub2", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-date-beginninggameB|T128", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "It looks awfully empty… and are you sure this is the best…", "passage": "sleep-date-beginninggameB", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-date-beginninggameB|T129", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "It’s too soon to say.", "passage": "sleep-date-beginninggameB", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-date-beginninggameC|T134", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "It looks awfully empty. Tomorrow, you’ll have a chance to fill it up more.", "passage": "sleep-date-beginninggameC", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-date-middlegameA|T139", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "It’s slowly filling up.", "passage": "sleep-date-middlegameA", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-date-middlegameA|T140", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You wipe your hand over your face, like it’ll help sleep come.", "passage": "sleep-date-middlegameA", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-date-middlegameA|T141", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Your fingers are shaking. Stress, probably.", "passage": "sleep-date-middlegameA", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-date-middlegameB|T146", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Your investigation is taking shape. Little by little. Who’d have thought?!", "passage": "sleep-date-middlegameB", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-date-middlegameB|T147", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "If only Busset would give you a little more time…", "passage": "sleep-date-middlegameB", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-date-middlegameC|T152", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You hope to find more information… tonight, even… as soon as you wake up.", "passage": "sleep-date-middlegameC", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
