{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-date-endgameA|T158", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "To be honest, you’re completely… lost…", "passage": "sleep-date-endgameA", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-date-endgameB|T163", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Your hands are shaking. You don’t quite know what’s happening around you anymore.", "passage": "sleep-date-endgameB", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-date-endgameB|T164", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "For a short moment, the room around you starts to flutter.", "passage": "sleep-date-endgameB", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-date-endgameC|T169", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You wish you were far away from here.", "passage": "sleep-date-endgameC", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-date-endgameC|T170", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Far, far away from here.", "passage": "sleep-date-endgameC", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-date-lastnight|T175", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You sigh when you think that… in just a few hours… it’ll all be over.", "passage": "sleep-date-lastnight", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-date-lastnight|T176", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You’ll have answers. Busset will have her arrest. Paris will be peaceful again.", "passage": "sleep-date-lastnight", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-date-lastnight|T177", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "But what about you? What’ll you do?", "passage": "sleep-date-lastnight", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-hub3|T182", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You shake your head and your mind wanders for a second…", "passage": "sleep-hub3", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-003alaric|T232", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You think about that kid who was going to mass.", "passage": "sleep-client-003alaric", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-003alaric|T233", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "What language did he hope they’d speak in? Greek?", "passage": "sleep-client-003alaric", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-003alaric|T234", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Greek… that was it… weird language… for mass.", "passage": "sleep-client-003alaric", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-009ludwig|T240", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You hope to fall asleep quickly.", "passage": "sleep-client-009ludwig", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-009ludwig|T241", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "So you’ll be in good shape tonight. So you won’t be distracted at the wheel. So you won’t fall asleep. Won’t see that little ghost again.", "passage": "sleep-client-009ludwig", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
