{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-013leia|T250", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You smile, thinking about that… weird… young girl.", "passage": "sleep-client-013leia", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-013leia|T251", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Who talked about the movies like her life depended on it. It was like she was… consumed by her passion.", "passage": "sleep-client-013leia", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-013leia|T252", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You’d have liked to…", "passage": "sleep-client-013leia", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-014fragonard|T259", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "And that old cop with all his stories…", "passage": "sleep-client-014fragonard", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-014fragonard-killer|T265", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You understand why Busset doesn’t dare look into him.", "passage": "sleep-client-014fragonard-killer", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
