{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-016gerard|T290", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "In the… fog…", "passage": "sleep-client-016gerard", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-019herve|T297", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "A draft chills you to the bone.", "passage": "sleep-client-019herve", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-019herve|T298", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You know exactly where it came from; a flaw in the front door… a matter of a few centimeters…", "passage": "sleep-client-019herve", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-019herve|T299", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You hope Hervé found shelter for the night.", "passage": "sleep-client-019herve", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-022claudia|T306", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Of course you start thinking about that beautiful woman… so sad… so dark.", "passage": "sleep-client-022claudia", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-022claudia|T307", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You wish she’d have invited you over for real, that she’d…", "passage": "sleep-client-022claudia", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-022claudia|T308", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "That she’d lay her hand on your shoulder…", "passage": "sleep-client-022claudia", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
