{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-022claudia|T310", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You shake your head, drive her out of your mind and stare at the ceiling for a second.", "passage": "sleep-client-022claudia", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-022claudia|T311", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "That woman… a killer? No, no. There’s no way…", "passage": "sleep-client-022claudia", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-022claudia|T312", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "And… yet…", "passage": "sleep-client-022claudia", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-037shinji|T319", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "A smile forms on your lips.", "passage": "sleep-client-037shinji", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-037shinji|T320", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You just thought about that Japanese tourist. You imagine the joy on his face when he got home and rediscovered the sounds and smells of his country.", "passage": "sleep-client-037shinji", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-037shinji|T321", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Like… you… when you would come back from France…", "passage": "sleep-client-037shinji", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-037shinji|T322", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "At the end of the summer…", "passage": "sleep-client-037shinji", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-042djena|T329", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "As you think about that young doctor, you can’t help but feel both relieved and ashamed.", "passage": "sleep-client-042djena", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-042djena|T330", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Relieved because… you’re only a cab driver…", "passage": "sleep-client-042djena", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-042djena|T331", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "And ashamed because… you’re only…", "passage": "sleep-client-042djena", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-042djena|T332", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "A cab…", "passage": "sleep-client-042djena", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-043jonas|T339", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "What if the world is really just a simulation? What if your world is just a game? Somebody else’s leisure activity?", "passage": "sleep-client-043jonas", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-043jonas|T340", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Would that radically change what you do?", "passage": "sleep-client-043jonas", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
