{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-043jonas|T343", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "But the choices you make… your… fate…", "passage": "sleep-client-043jonas", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-064janet|T350", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You think about those strange visits… that young woman who says she’s from the future…", "passage": "sleep-client-064janet", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-064janet|T351", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Each time, you’re completely convinced she’s real and…", "passage": "sleep-client-064janet", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-064janet|T352", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Yet…", "passage": "sleep-client-064janet", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-064janet|T353", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "That makes… no… sense…", "passage": "sleep-client-064janet", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-064janet|T354", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "No one can… travel… through…", "passage": "sleep-client-064janet", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-067matthieu|T361", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You think about that passenger… and his baby carrier.", "passage": "sleep-client-067matthieu", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-067matthieu|T362", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "How sad. What a strange situation.", "passage": "sleep-client-067matthieu", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-067matthieu|T363", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You can’t imagine… his distress…", "passage": "sleep-client-067matthieu", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-067matthieu|T364", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "His… pain…", "passage": "sleep-client-067matthieu", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-070antoine|T371", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You smile, thinking about that… concierge.", "passage": "sleep-client-070antoine", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-070antoine|T372", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "What a story. Hundreds of millions of euros.", "passage": "sleep-client-070antoine", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-070antoine|T373", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "One hell of a fortune. And he keeps living… like… nothing had happened…", "passage": "sleep-client-070antoine", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-072pierrette|T380", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Obviously, you think about… her.", "passage": "sleep-client-072pierrette", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-072pierrette0|T387", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You should have gone up.", "passage": "sleep-client-072pierrette0", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-072pierrette0|T388", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Who cares if she was…", "passage": "sleep-client-072pierrette0", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-072pierrette0|T389", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "It would have been… nice…", "passage": "sleep-client-072pierrette0", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-072pierrette0|T390", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Uncommon…", "passage": "sleep-client-072pierrette0", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-072pierrette1|T395", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You smile. You shouldn't have gone up but…", "passage": "sleep-client-072pierrette1", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-072pierrette2|T400", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Your mind wanders for a few more seconds.", "passage": "sleep-client-072pierrette2", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-072pierrette2|T401", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Visions of breasts, naked bodies, flexed muscles… dance in your head…", "passage": "sleep-client-072pierrette2", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-074emilia|T408", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Of course, it brings you back to the scene in the Bois de Vincennes.", "passage": "sleep-client-074emilia", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-074emilia|T409", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "That cat…", "passage": "sleep-client-074emilia", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-074emilia|T410", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "The meowing…", "passage": "sleep-client-074emilia", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-074emilia|T411", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "And that huge, orange cloud hanging over Paris…", "passage": "sleep-client-074emilia", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-074emilia|T412", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Ready to…", "passage": "sleep-client-074emilia", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-074emilia|T413", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Collapse…", "passage": "sleep-client-074emilia", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-077santa|T420", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "And a question comes to mind…", "passage": "sleep-client-077santa", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-077santa|T421", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "A very odd one…", "passage": "sleep-client-077santa", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-077santa|T422", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "So odd you need to say it out loud to be sure you’re not dreaming.", "passage": "sleep-client-077santa", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-077santa|T423", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "« Was that really Santa Claus? »", "passage": "sleep-client-077santa", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-077santa|T424", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You lie there for a moment… listening to the echo of your own voice resonating around your studio apartment.", "passage": "sleep-client-077santa", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-077santa|T425", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "The silence lulls you…", "passage": "sleep-client-077santa", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-090houssine|T432", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You shake your head, push those thoughts away.", "passage": "sleep-client-090houssine", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-090houssine|T433", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You tell yourself that if you fall asleep quickly… that if you sleep well…", "passage": "sleep-client-090houssine", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-090houssine|T434", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "He won’t be back.", "passage": "sleep-client-090houssine", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-090houssine|T435", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "His cigarette either.", "passage": "sleep-client-090houssine", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-090houssine|T436", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "That guy with…", "passage": "sleep-client-090houssine", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-090houssine|T437", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Your… face…", "passage": "sleep-client-090houssine", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-097alexandre|T444", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "For some unknown reason, your passenger’s tear-stained face appears in your mind.", "passage": "sleep-client-097alexandre", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-097alexandre|T445", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "He seems paralyzed with sadness… incapable of moving… incapable of living one more second.", "passage": "sleep-client-097alexandre", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-097alexandre|T446", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You turn your back to your investigation board; you don’t want to see his face up there.", "passage": "sleep-client-097alexandre", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-client-097alexandre|T447", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You don’t want… to think about… that… anymore.", "passage": "sleep-client-097alexandre", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-end-basic01|T478", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "And suddenly, you’re asleep.", "passage": "sleep-end-basic01", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-end-basic02|T483", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "A second later, you’re asleep.", "passage": "sleep-end-basic02", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-end-basic03|T488", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Your eyelids flutter once and you’re asleep.", "passage": "sleep-end-basic03", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-end-nightmare01|T494", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Right when you’re about to fall asleep… something rubs up against your leg.", "passage": "sleep-end-nightmare01", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-end-nightmare01|T495", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You prop your head up and, just there in the shadows, you see a face… It looks like a combination of the faces of all your suspects.", "passage": "sleep-end-nightmare01", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-end-nightmare01|T496", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You wake with a start, look quickly around you. There’s no one there.", "passage": "sleep-end-nightmare01", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-end-nightmare01|T497", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You lie back down, feeling restless.", "passage": "sleep-end-nightmare01", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-end-nightmare02|T503", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Your eyes close. You fall asleep. Something is bothering you… something stuck in your throat.", "passage": "sleep-end-nightmare02", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-end-nightmare02|T504", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You start coughing over and over. You lean out of bed.", "passage": "sleep-end-nightmare02", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-end-nightmare02|T505", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "A black shadow creeps out of your mouth and bangs loudly on the floor.", "passage": "sleep-end-nightmare02", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-end-nightmare02|T506", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You wake with a start.", "passage": "sleep-end-nightmare02", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-end-nightmare02|T507", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "« Fucking nightmare… »", "passage": "sleep-end-nightmare02", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-end-nightmare02|T508", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You glance at the floor; there’s nothing there. You lie back down, still shaking.", "passage": "sleep-end-nightmare02", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-end-nightmare03|T514", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You suddenly fall asleep.", "passage": "sleep-end-nightmare03", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-end-nightmare03|T515", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Your breath becomes slow and steady… until you understand you are no longer breathing.", "passage": "sleep-end-nightmare03", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-end-nightmare03|T516", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You open your eyes and look at your chest… Something has cut out a square of skin and flesh… in order to pull out your lungs.", "passage": "sleep-end-nightmare03", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-end-nightmare03|T517", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "« Shit! »", "passage": "sleep-end-nightmare03", "source": "textasset", "es": "« ¡Mierda! »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false, "origin": "tm"}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-end-nightmare03|T518", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You sit up in your bed and breathe.", "passage": "sleep-end-nightmare03", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-end-nightmare03|T519", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "A nightmare. It was just a nightmare…", "passage": "sleep-end-nightmare03", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-end-nightmare03|T520", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You fall almost immediately back to sleep.", "passage": "sleep-end-nightmare03", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-end-weird01|T525", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Just when you’re about to fall asleep, you think you hear a voice in the distance…", "passage": "sleep-end-weird01", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-end-weird01-voice01|T530", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "??? : « Two and two… »", "passage": "sleep-end-weird01-voice01", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-end-weird01-voice02|T535", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "??? : « She’s not telling the whole truth. »", "passage": "sleep-end-weird01-voice02", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-end-weird01-voice03|T540", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "??? : « He doesn’t judge souls. »", "passage": "sleep-end-weird01-voice03", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-end-weird01-voice04|T545", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "??? : « He’s crying. »", "passage": "sleep-end-weird01-voice04", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-end-weird01-outro|T550", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You jump… without understanding where the voice is coming from…", "passage": "sleep-end-weird01-outro", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-end-weird01-outro|T551", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Outside, Paris is waking up.", "passage": "sleep-end-weird01-outro", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-end-weird01-outro|T552", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "And you fall asleep.", "passage": "sleep-end-weird01-outro", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-end-weird02|T557", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Your eyes close and you can feel yourself drifting off…", "passage": "sleep-end-weird02", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-end-weird02|T558", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Until you hear a voice break out in the distance.", "passage": "sleep-end-weird02", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-end-weird02-voice01|T563", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "??? : « He’s desperate. »", "passage": "sleep-end-weird02-voice01", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-end-weird02-voice02|T568", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "??? : « The cat is dead. »", "passage": "sleep-end-weird02-voice02", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-end-weird02-voice03|T573", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "??? : « He looks Tunisian. »", "passage": "sleep-end-weird02-voice03", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-end-weird02-voice04|T578", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "??? : « Look… he’s kicking the bucket. »", "passage": "sleep-end-weird02-voice04", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-end-weird02-outro|T583", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "And then… silence.", "passage": "sleep-end-weird02-outro", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-end-weird02-outro|T584", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You close your eyes… without any idea where the voice is coming from.", "passage": "sleep-end-weird02-outro", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-end-weird02-outro|T585", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "A second later, you’re asleep.", "passage": "sleep-end-weird02-outro", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-end-weird03|T590", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Your eyes close.", "passage": "sleep-end-weird03", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-end-weird03|T591", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Right when you’re about to fall asleep… you notice a taste on your tongue.", "passage": "sleep-end-weird03", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-end-weird03|T592", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "It’s very salty, like soy sauce. A tad bitter. Very strong.", "passage": "sleep-end-weird03", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-end-weird03|T593", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "It disappears as quickly as it came.", "passage": "sleep-end-weird03", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "930_sleep|sleep-end-weird03|T594", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You fall asleep.", "passage": "sleep-end-weird03", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
